  "remarks": "Reportedly killed in an air strike in Syria on 25 May 2015. A veteran member of the ‘Chechen Network’ (not listed) and other terrorist groups. He was convicted of his role and membership in the ‘Chechen Network’ in France in 2006. Joined Jabhat al-Nusrah, formerly listed as Al-Nusrah Front for the People of the Levant in October 2013. Father’s name: Mohamed. Mother’s name: Saliha Boukhari. Photograph and fingerprints available for inclusion in INTERPOL-UNSC Special Notice INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice:https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals",
